applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ITO GENTA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOMAHARA MAKOTO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TANABE SHIGEKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ITO, GENTA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOMAHARA, MAKOTO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TANABE, SHIGEKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A notebook-sized personal computer (50) with a built-in modem comprises a main body (51) including a printed-circuit board assembly (57). A notebook-sized personal computer (80) with built-in LAN comprises a main body (51) including a printed-circuit board assembly (82). The printed-circuit board assembly (57) and the printed-circuit board assembly (82) use similar printed-circuit boards (60). The printed-circuit board assembly (57) comprises a printed-circuit board (60) provided with a modem module/connector assembly (61). The printed-circuit board assembly (82) comprises a printed-circuit board (60) provided with a LAN module/connector assembly (83).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un ordinateur personnel (50) portable équipé d'un modem intégré, comprenant un corps principal (51) possédant un ensemble de cartes de circuit imprimé (57). Un ordinateur personnel (80) portable équipé d'un LAN intégré comprend un corps principal (51), pourvu d'un ensemble de cartes de circuit imprimé (82). L'ensemble de cartes de circuit imprimé (57) et l'ensemble de cartes de circuit imprimé (82) utilisent des cartes de circuit imprimé (60) identiques. L'ensemble de cartes de circuit imprimé (57) comprend une carte de circuit imprimé (60) possédant un module de modem/ensemble connecteur (61). L'ensemble de cartes de circuit imprimé (82) comprend une carte de circuit imprimé (60) possédant un module LAN/ensemble connecteur (83).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>